-- Hosbah: one row per server (MH-580 J1) holding the input chain's default policy and the SSH port
-- the agent must always keep open. default_policy defaults to 'accept' so a server with no rules
-- yet is never accidentally locked down; switching it to 'drop' is a deliberate, confirmed action
-- (see internal/api/firewall.go) because it can cut off anything not explicitly allowed.
